2. Meta-analyses were EXCLUDED (not primary RCTs)                                                                       
3. Studies in patients with inherited bleeding disorders (von Willebrand disease, Bernard-Soulier syndrome) were        
EXCLUDED per review objective                                                                                           
4. Studies in patients with acquired bleeding disorders (cirrhosis, uremia) were EXCLUDED per review objective          
5. Studies focusing on thromboprophylaxis rather than bleeding reduction were EXCLUDED                                  
